<BaseLayout title="Projects" active="projects">
  <section><h3>Projects</h3>
<div class="item"><strong><a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/fast-auto-ml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fast-auto-ml</a></strong><p>Self-serve AutoML web app: upload a CSV/XLSX, pick a target column, and get a trained scikit-learn model, a Markdown model card, and an executed notebook/HTML report — all within a 5-minute wall-clock budget.</p><p><span class='tag'>Python</span> · <span class='tag'>FastAPI</span> · <span class='tag'>scikit-learn</span></p></div>
<div class="item"><strong><a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/Black-Holes-Shadows" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Black-Holes-Shadows</a></strong><p>Ray-traces null geodesics to render black-hole shadow and gravitational-lensing images, for both a Weyl-coordinate Schwarzschild black hole with an accretion disk and a Kerr (rotating) black hole.</p><p><span class='tag'>Python</span> · <span class='tag'>NumPy/SciPy</span> · <span class='tag'>Numba</span></p></div>
</section>
<section><h3>Useful tools</h3>
<p>A collection of independent day-to-day tools living in <a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/useful-tools" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">neiro-data/useful-tools</a>, each its own self-contained subproject:</p>
<div class="item"><strong><a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/useful-tools/tree/main/time-tracker-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">time-tracker-app</a></strong><p>Offline-first time tracker.</p><p><span class='tag'>Python</span> · <span class='tag'>FastAPI</span> · <span class='tag'>SQLite</span> · <span class='tag'>React</span></p></div>
<div class="item"><strong><a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/useful-tools/tree/main/webpage-time-tracker-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">webpage-time-tracker-app</a></strong><p>Browser-based front end for the time tracker.</p><p><span class='tag'>JavaScript</span> · <span class='tag'>React</span></p></div>
<div class="item"><strong><a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/useful-tools/tree/main/tool-sql-to-drawio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tool-sql-to-drawio</a></strong><p>Generates draw.io ER diagrams from SQL DDL.</p><p><span class='tag'>Python</span></p></div>
<div class="item"><strong><a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/useful-tools/tree/main/tool-pdf-to-epub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tool-pdf-to-epub</a></strong><p>Converts PDF documents to EPUB.</p><p><span class='tag'>Python</span></p></div>
<div class="item"><strong><a href="https://github.com/neiro-data/useful-tools/tree/main/tool-html-to-epub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tool-html-to-epub</a></strong><p>Converts HTML pages/articles to EPUB.</p><p><span class='tag'>Python</span></p></div>
